     1,
     "<div bgcolor=\"#f6f6f6\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;min-height:100%;width:100%\"><div>-------- Forwarded Message --------</div><div><b>From</b>: Google Summer of Code &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">summerofco...@google.com</a>&gt;</div><div><b>To</b>: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bgpbra...@gmail.com</a></div><div><b>Subject</b>: GSoC 2021: Important Notes for final weeks of program</div><div><b>Date</b>: Thu, 05 Aug 2021 22:30:05 -0700</div><div><br></div>     <table bgcolor=\"#f6f6f6\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:20px 20px 10px 20px;width:100%\"> <tbody><tr style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\"> <td style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\"></td> <td bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:20px 20px 20px 20px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0;clear:both;display:block;Margin:0 auto;max-width:600px\"> <table width=\"100%\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;border-bottom:2px solid #f0f0f0;margin-bottom:20px\"> <tbody><tr style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\"> <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\"> <img width=\"280\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Google Summer of Code\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/v7BjypS1rczHOKzxzRU-LdtkFv_J3drGf6tjwBFMSSlGwQrHSM3ZjgRroIV3r1ANM14pOCG-F41rBmNUA1K79eaf21t8ZsNGmlk_nuoZrpDYTTPOgA5DAx8ZNQ=s0-d-e1-ft#https://storage.googleapis.com/gsoc-static/summer-of-code-logo-email.png\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:600px;font-size:32px;width:auto;margin-bottom:10px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;color:#666666\"> </td> </tr> </tbody></table>  <div style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;padding:0;margin:0 auto;display:block;max-width:600px\"> <table style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;width:100%\"> <tbody><tr style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\"> <td style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\"> <p style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:10px\">Thank you for being a vital part of the GSoC 2021 program. We realize this has been another challenging year for everyone, thank you all for your commitment to your students and your communities.</p><p>In about a week and a half, students will begin submitting their Final Evaluations and work products for GSoC 2021 (starting Monday, August 16). We have encouraged students to reach out to you to share a preview of their submission URL and let you verify it meets <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/open-source/gsoc/help/work-product\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://developers.google.com/open-source/gsoc/help/work-product&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351210566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3SyvkjplPcWRUqJHyM4PTu\">Google&#39;s</a> and your requirements before they submit later this month. Students can not edit their evaluations once they have submitted them — it&#39;s in their best interest to have you review the link first. FYI, students must submit their Final Evaluations (with the submission URL) on their Google dashboard before Monday, August 23 at 18:00 UTC.</p><p><strong>Mentor Final Evaluations (of students) Start Monday, August 23rd at 18:01 UTC </strong><br>Mentors are responsible for validating the target of the URL (provided in the evaluation), making sure it points to the GSoC 2021 work product, and meets the other <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/open-source/gsoc/help/work-product\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://developers.google.com/open-source/gsoc/help/work-product&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351210566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3SyvkjplPcWRUqJHyM4PTu\">requirements</a>. Mentors will use this information as part of their pass/fail decision. The <strong>deadline for Mentors to submit</strong> <strong>Final</strong> <strong>Evaluations is Monday, August 30 at 18:00 UTC.</strong></p><p>You can preview the final evaluation questions <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/open-source/gsoc/help/evaluations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://developers.google.com/open-source/gsoc/help/evaluations&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351210566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0T6vkeH2Ly5UFRp6au9RfX\">here</a>.</p><h3>Tips for communicating with your Student these last couple of weeks</h3><p>It is very important to keep communicating with your students and encourage them to remain involved with your community. The orgs that have been most successful in keeping their GSoC students as long term contributors to their project have encouraged their students to become maintainers on their projects and make it clear they have ownership of a particular area of the project. Encourage the students to stay invested in the work they have done over the GSoC period.</p><p>Be sure to read the <a href=\"https://google.github.io/gsocguides/mentor/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://google.github.io/gsocguides/mentor/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351210566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2c-an7iNh2C0UnvidOLn66\">Mentor Guide</a> section on <a href=\"https://google.github.io/gsocguides/mentor/building-a-lifetime-contributor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://google.github.io/gsocguides/mentor/building-a-lifetime-contributor&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351210566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2B9PQdVAE17vix8zx6i57E\">Building a Lifetime Contributor</a> for more tips.</p><h3>Upcoming Important Dates</h3><p><strong>August 16-23</strong>: Students wrap up their projects and submit final evaluation of their mentor which includes:<br> 1) link to their work product (code) and<br>2) their Final Evaluation of their Mentor<br><strong>August 23 18:00 UTC: </strong>Deadline for Students to submit their Final Evaluation<br><strong>August 23-30</strong>: <strong>Mentors submit final evaluations of students</strong><br><strong>August 30 18:00 UTC: Deadline for submission of Mentor&#39;s Final Evaluation of their Student</strong><br><strong>August 31</strong>: Students passing GSoC 2021 are announced<br><strong>Late October/early Nov:</strong> Mentor Summit (date TBD)</p><h3>Important Links</h3><p>Reminder to read these 1-pagers from the <a href=\"https://google.github.io/gsocguides/mentor/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://google.github.io/gsocguides/mentor/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351210566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2c-an7iNh2C0UnvidOLn66\">GSoC Mentor Guide</a>: <a href=\"https://google.github.io/gsocguides/mentor/building-a-lifetime-contributor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://google.github.io/gsocguides/mentor/building-a-lifetime-contributor&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351210567000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3saxtJHnRypBQj4lexqLBp\">Building a Lifetime Contributor</a>, <a href=\"https://google.github.io/gsocguides/mentor/upstream-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://google.github.io/gsocguides/mentor/upstream-integration&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351210567000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YkI5ochBi2Ed_moEXjwOU\">Upstream Integration</a><br><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/open-source/gsoc/help/responsibilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://developers.google.com/open-source/gsoc/help/responsibilities&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351210567000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2hZH_2n6371Fnv2hRsbTV0\">Roles and Responsibilities</a><br><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pxrT8hPPhh0rCSuanVQinGHQKp4Pev0oXkDU2a7UU68/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pxrT8hPPhh0rCSuanVQinGHQKp4Pev0oXkDU2a7UU68/edit?usp%3Dsharing&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351210567000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2PJnNc8bEYr437wTnyJcLo\">GSoC 2021 Mentor and Org Admin Email Archive</a></p><p>Please email Google Administrators at <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gsoc-s...@google.com</a> if you have any questions.</p><p>Best, Stephanie</p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </div>  </td> <td style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\"></td> </tr> </tbody></table> <ta